# Upcoming groups entries by day, earliest first, document order within a day, so j walks them in that order past the headings.
file <<END
- Late @due({today+5})
- Soon A @due({today+1})
- Middle @start({today+3})
- Soon B @due({today+1})
END
keys gU
see Tomorrow ·
see ▌ - Soon A
keys j
see ▌ - Soon B
keys j
see ▌ - Middle
keys j
see ▌ - Late
keys j
see ▌ - Late
keys x
quit
saved <<END
- Late @due({today+5}) @done({today})
- Soon A @due({today+1})
- Middle @start({today+3})
- Soon B @due({today+1})
END
